    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Everyday Essentials Bundle consists of <\/p><ul><li>Teeth Whitening Blue Light Accelerator <\/li><li>12x Whitening Gels<\/li><li>14x Teeth Whitening Strips<\/li><li>Teeth Whitening Pen<\/li><li>Teeth Monitoring Shade Guide<\/li><li>Thermoforming Mouth Trays x4<\/li><li>Manual<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>All products sold on Smile Therapy <br\/>are:<strong> <\/strong><em><strong>100% Safe, Vegan & Certified!<br\/><br\/><\/strong><\/em><strong>Teeth Whitening Gels:<\/strong><br\/>Sorbitol, Phthalimidoperoxycaproic Acid, Propylene Glycol, Glycerin, Potassium Nitrate,Polyethylene Glycol-8, Hydroxyapatite, Cellulose Gum, Hydroxyethyl Cellulose, Xanthan Gum, Saccharin Sodium, Methylparaben, Sodium Bicarbonate, Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Extract, Chamomilla Recutita Flower, (Chamomile) Extract, Punica Granatum Seed (Pomegranate), Extract, Propylparaben<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "792a2454-8dbe-40ac-ae87-a745eb01fb9b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions & Tips",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>1) Start by selecting your preferred mode on the electric toothbrush, applying toothpaste, and then gently dabbing it onto the teeth whitening powder.<\/p><p>2) Brush as usual, making sure to cover all four quadrants of your mouth. The toothbrush has a built-in 30-second timer to guide you.<\/p><p>3) Rinse your mouth with warm water, then use the Stainless Steel Tongue Scraper.<\/p><p>4) Extend the scraper wide, stick out your tongue, and carefully scrape off any white coating.<\/p><p>5) After 60 seconds, or once the coating is removed, rinse your mouth again, and you're ready to start your day with a fresh, bright smile.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "22779142-8db6-4dbf-93b6-ac3fd9d5b799": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings & Caution",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>All products sold on our website have been researched and tested thoroughly to ensure maximum safety of all our customers. <\/p><p>This product is not to be used while pregnant or breastfeeding.<\/p><p>This product is not recommended for those under the age of 12.<\/p><p>If residue from the powder is swallowed in small quantities please do not worry.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nbAPbH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Teeth Whitening Kit be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Teeth Whitening Kit is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While the kit is designed to safely whiten your natural teeth, it also helps to remove surface stains on dental restorations. The formula is gentle on all dental materials, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings remain intact while your smile is brightened.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
